+# Invoice review service
+
+This repository contains a TypeScript service for reviewing invoice line items and returning findings for a human finance operator. It never authorizes or sends a payment.
+
+The current source defines invoice lines with a string reference and an amount in cents. It detects repeated references and returns the unique duplicate references in sorted order.
+
+The README also describes arithmetic mismatch review, but the current source does not establish arithmetic mismatch detection behavior.
